{
  "name": "Sales Analyser",
  "description": "An agent that turns monthly sales spreadsheets in SharePoint into trustworthy analysis: it cleans and reconciles the data, computes YoY, MoM, QoQ and YTD metrics with live currency conversion and outlier flags, explains every transformation, and delivers a branded PDF report and an Outlook-ready newsletter email.",
